130
01:10:15.178 --> 01:10:17.178
Ik was zo van, ja, wat ga ik nou doen?

131
01:10:17.178 --> 01:10:20.178
Ga ik nou open over relaties doen?

132
01:10:20.178 --> 01:10:24.178
